     "<div dir=\"ltr\">All, we&#39;ll be holding a NIMBLE virtual training workshop, January 4-6, from 8 am to 1 pm US Pacific (California) time. As part of the workshop, we&#39;ll be discussing NIMBLE&#39;s <a href=\"https://r-nimble.org/beta-version-of-nimble-with-automatic-differentiation-including-hmc-sampling-and-laplace-approximation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://r-nimble.org/beta-version-of-nimble-with-automatic-differentiation-including-hmc-sampling-and-laplace-approximation&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244879597000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xpRoeN49h3ZrxhEgwJa-b\">new AD capabilities</a> in detail.<div><br></div><div>Details and registration information can be found <a href=\"https://r-nimble.org/nimble-virtual-short-course-january-4-6-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://r-nimble.org/nimble-virtual-short-course-january-4-6-2023&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244879597000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-ggu7qmq1RkZq3RV7CAv1\">here</a>.</div><div><br></div><div>-Chris (for the NIMBLE development team)</div></div>\r\n"
